      "explanation": "<p>Friedel Craft’s reaction is an electrophilic substitution reaction. In this reaction, the intermediate carbocation formed acts as an electrophile and attacks the benzene ring. Vinyl chloride does not react with benzene as its intermediate carbocation is too unstable.</p>"
